{"game": "warframe", "language": "english", "appid": 230410, "month": "2013-10", "window": 3, "start_date": 1381881600, "end_date": 1382572799, "month_true_total": 225, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-14 18:50:37 Pacific Daylight Time", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "7457855", "author": {"steamid": "76561198056053338", "personaname": "WhiteSky_(steemdeck)", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/WhiteSky_/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 526452, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 3444, "playtime_at_review": 100215, "last_played": 1789436999, "avatar": "8d4313cbfa439a8b1ea54a68b987c8cd666f405f"}, "language": "english", "review": "[strike]This game is mindshateringly awesome. keep in mind that all games take a few days to get used to and get good at, warframe is a grind, but it is awesome.[/strike]\n\nA YEAR LATER\n\nwhat started last year as an amazing game with player friendly devs has turned into paylock/grindlock with devs that ignore player feedback (note: player ideas, not bug reports). for new players, the game is worth a few hundred hours. but for myself and most other players with 1500+ hours, the game is tired and after $300+ spent the desire to pour money into the game and get grind as a reward is less enticing than it originally was.\n\nDO I RECCOMEND THE GAME?\nyes, you should at least give the game a shot, its mechanics are fun!\n\nDO I STILL PLAY THE GAME?\noccasionally, but no, not really.\nWHY?\ni have no interest in playign hours on end for rewards that are 100% not garunteed. the RNG reward generator needs to be retired, the Devs need to be less focused on making money, and return to making the game fun liek it originally was.\n\nMiracl3 - mastery 17 - Master Founder\n4/2013-9/2014", "timestamp_created": 1382549342, "timestamp_updated": 1418439050, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "rec